all licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0.
nex-protocols-common-go's Ranking package is used via the same vendored fork
as hyrule-warriors-nex (internal/nex-protocols-common-go-patch/ranking,
datastore subpackage dropped - Art of Balance links no DataStore): upstream
v2.4.0 has no mode-aware ranking query (range/user/near/friend-range) and no
PID-scoped GetCommonData, only a single flat
GetRankingsAndCountByCategoryAndRankingOrderParam callback. Every other
package (match-making, matchmake-extension, etc.) is the unmodified upstream
release, which provisions its own matchmaking / tracking PostgreSQL schema
(see docs/matchmaking-schema.md).

The Art of Balance NEX configuration (game server ID 10135000 shared across
regions, title IDs 0005000010135000 / 0005000010149400 / 000500001017cb00
across USA/EUR/JPN, access key 96900116, NEX 3.7.1) started from static
analysis of the game's own executable (this title has no kinnay.github.io or
Pretendo Network entry) and was confirmed against a real Wii U console and
packet captures - see RECON.md. No proprietary Nintendo or Shin'en code or
assets are included.
